:: Marta [actor: marta]

{hello}
“Evening. Foul night for it.”

{ask storm}
“Three days of it now. The river's never been so high.”

{ask storm, again}
“Still raining, love. Still raining.”

{ask road}
“The bridge road? Ask Tobias. He was out that way this morning.”

{ask facts.bridgeOut}
“Gone? Then nobody's leaving tomorrow but by the ferry.”

{ask facts.wrenIsCourier}
“The duchess's courier, under my roof? Well. She pays like one.”

{ask wren}
“Came in at dusk, soaked through. Keeps to herself.”

{ask room, opens: settling}
“Up the stairs, on the right. You'll settle up now, before I forget?”

{bye}
“Mind the stairs.”

:: Marta settling [actor: marta, node: settling]

{yes}
{on enter: night.paid = true}
“Bless you.” She drops your coins in the till.

{no}
“In the morning, then. I'll remember.”

:: Tobias [actor: tobias]

{hello}
“Mm?”

{ask road}
“Road's fine as far as the bridge. The bridge isn't. Washed clean away this afternoon.”
{reveal facts.bridgeOut, from: tobias}

{ask facts.bridgeOut}
“Watched it go. Took a cart with it.”

{ask stew}
“Mutton. Don't ask what else.”

{ask or tell anything}
Tobias grunts and goes on with his work.

{bye implicit}
Tobias goes back to what he was doing.

{bye explicit}
“Mm.”

:: Wren [actor: wren]

{hello}
“Oh. Hello.”

{ask road}
“I came the bridge road. Before.”

{ask facts.bridgeOut}
“Then the ferry's the only way across. It goes at first light, storm or no.”

{ask ferryman}
“Old Hesk. He'll take anything across, if it's paid for.”

{ask letter, -> Wren's Tale}
“It isn't mine to tell. But you should know who you'd be helping.”
{reveal facts.wrenIsCourier, from: wren}

{ask facts.wrenIsCourier}
“Keep that to yourself. Please.”

{ask or tell anything}
“I wouldn't know.”

{bye}
“Goodnight.”

:: Wren favour [actor: wren, node: favour]

{ask letter, stays}
“It must reach the ferryman at first light. I can't be seen at the river.”

{yes}
{on enter: promise()}
“Thank you.” She presses a sealed letter into your hand. “Hesk will know what to do.”

{no}
{on enter: night.refused = true}
“I see.” She turns away. “Forget I asked.”
